          "message": {
            "text": "Vulnerability found\n\nThe airDrop function checks for hasNoBalance before supportsToken, making it vulnerable to a reentrancy attack by allowing a contract with any balance to call the function.\n\nImpact: A malicious actor could potentially drain all available tokens.\n\nRemediation: Ensure that hasNoBalance check is executed before supportsToken in the airDrop function."
          },
